{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02495",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.08,
      "end_seconds": 2.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 3.17,
      "end_seconds": 8.34,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "Yes, come in and sit down. What brings you here today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 10.33,
      "end_seconds": 15.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.39,
      "text": "Doctor, I'll sit in if that's okay, I know what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.44,
      "end_seconds": 21.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "So the thing is, I've got a weak urine stream."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.54,
      "end_seconds": 25.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Is it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.83,
      "end_seconds": 38.64,
      "duration_seconds": 7.81,
      "text": "Right, pretty severe, if I'm being honest. I've, I've also had dribbling after passing urine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.19,
      "end_seconds": 46.82,
      "duration_seconds": 7.63,
      "text": "Okay, go on. Have you had a weak urine stream before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.82,
      "end_seconds": 54.48,
      "duration_seconds": 6.66,
      "text": "A bit, about six months ago. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.65,
      "end_seconds": 69.72,
      "duration_seconds": 8.07,
      "text": "Have you noticed back pain, blood in the urine, weight loss or burning on passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.62,
      "end_seconds": 80.83,
      "duration_seconds": 10.21,
      "text": "Mm, I haven't had back pain, blood in the urine, weight loss or burning on passing urine, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.63,
      "end_seconds": 87.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "Anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.77,
      "end_seconds": 90.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "No, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.79,
      "end_seconds": 93.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Alright, any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.37,
      "end_seconds": 99.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "No, uh, my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.83,
      "end_seconds": 102.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.7,
      "end_seconds": 107.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "I've had an underactive thyroid, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.85,
      "end_seconds": 111.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.0,
      "end_seconds": 116.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Erm, no, I'm not allergic to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.66,
      "end_seconds": 121.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.77,
      "end_seconds": 143.49,
      "duration_seconds": 20.72,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life. I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling. My husband and I live above the shop. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.52,
      "end_seconds": 148.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.44,
      "end_seconds": 154.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "I had a bunion operation six years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.45,
      "end_seconds": 174.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 176.34,
      "end_seconds": 179.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "It's thyroxine, 75 micrograms, every morning, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.18,
      "end_seconds": 184.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Alright, time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.78,
      "end_seconds": 197.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.98,
      "end_seconds": 222.03,
      "duration_seconds": 8.05,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 116 over 74, oxygen saturation is 98 percent, temperature is 36.6 degrees, pulse 75."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.38,
      "end_seconds": 224.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.4,
      "end_seconds": 229.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Don't worry, we'll discuss it in a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.84,
      "end_seconds": 235.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 249.1,
      "end_seconds": 250.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.09,
      "text": "Sure thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.18,
      "end_seconds": 253.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "I'll listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.71,
      "end_seconds": 268.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "The prostate feels smooth and enlarged with no hard areas."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.24,
      "end_seconds": 284.64,
      "duration_seconds": 12.4,
      "text": "You can sit up now. So, based on the history and the examination, my working impression is benign prostate enlargement. I'd also keep prostate cancer in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.67,
      "end_seconds": 287.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.36,
      "end_seconds": 323.26,
      "duration_seconds": 33.9,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like benign prostate enlargement, but I'd like to confirm. I think a urine dipstick makes sense here, for urinary symptoms. I'd like to arrange kidney function tests for urinary symptoms. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. For this, tamsulosin, 400 micrograms, once a day after food, long term. It's for urinary symptoms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 324.18,
      "end_seconds": 334.27,
      "duration_seconds": 10.09,
      "text": "Cut down on caffeine and fluids in the evening. I'll want another look after the results. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 335.16,
      "end_seconds": 338.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    }
  ]
}